  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>B</mi></math> are independent events<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mro